      "id": "claim_27f3b298aa6c4a19baa06c00bd22106c",
      "statement": "RSA public keys are serialized as base64-encoded SPKI DER (exportKey/importKey 'spki' with the RSA-OAEP params, encrypt-only usage) via the arrayBufferToBase64/base64ToArrayBuffer helpers (chunked 32 KiB base64 conversion for stack safety); tests/crypto-base64-wire.test.mjs (PR #72) pins the wire contract at runtime — byte-identical base64 round-trips across all remainder cases and a 1MB buffer matching the platform reference charset, and the RSA key survives export → base64 → import → re-export with JWK modulus/exponent intact.",
